; [new] card "np_sdkfz250_7" cost 430 lvl 1 | soldiers vehicle_supporter x4 | tags 44 mortar 45 43 42 41 | units/ger/vehicles_44.set:67 | also under ger_ss/v22; cards np_sdkfz250_7, np_sdkfz250_7_ss
{"np_sdkfz250_7" "The SdKfz 250 was a light armoured halftrack very similar in appearance to the larger Hanomag-designed SdKfz 251 which was built by the DEMAG firm for use by Nazi Germany in World War II. SdKfz 250/7 - light armoured halftrack with 81mm GrW 34 mortar."}
